<article class="env-proposition" id="BFB8">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/BFB8">Proposition <span data-tag="BFB8">6.2.2.5</span>.</a> Let $\calC $ be a small $\infty $-category containing an object $C$, and let $j: \calC \rightarrow \calP (\calC )$ be the Yoneda embedding. The construction described above yields a bijection </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  ( i: U \rightarrow j(C) ) \mapsto \calC _{/C}(U) \]
</div>
  <p> from $\Sub (j(C))$ to the set of all sieves on $C$. </p>
</article>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Use Corollary <a href="/tag/FF38" data-tag="FF38">5.1.6.12</a> to reduce to Lemma <a href="/tag/AF89" data-tag="AF89">6.2.2.4</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>